{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/extras/4a101de77119f482330b7a727da9649e.poster.avif?t=1760239236\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/extras/4a101de77119f482330b7a727da9649e.webm?t=1760239236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/extras/4a101de77119f482330b7a727da9649e.mp4?t=1760239236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cThere\u2019s no going back.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the nightmare with the <strong><i>Mutual Harrow Demo</i></strong>, a  psychological visual novel experience where your choices\u3000matter. In this demo, witness the desperate beginnings of Mina and Rex\u2019s flight... Family scars run deep, trust is a risk, and the line between hope and self-destruction blurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Mina and Rex as they escape trauma and face the haunting urban legend of Section 56... A forbidden wasteland of myth and danger. In this short, atmospheric teaser, you\u2019ll unravel their tangled pasts, confront their first mutual betrayals, and choose how they face a world set against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A ~10 Minute Teaser</strong><br>Begin the journey as Mina and Rex confront violence, memory, and the first cracks in their relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, Gritty Visuals and Soundtrack</strong><br>Grunge-inspired art and a haunting original score immerse you in the world\u2019s anxiety and decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Main Cast</strong><br>Experience the opening dynamic between Mina and Rex, whose volatile relationship drives the story forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. <i>Mutual Harrow Demo</i> gives a first taste of a dark, tragic story about trauma, love, and the myths we cling to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can two broken people trust each other, or is isolation their only escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/extras/32930fe984f0b0cefa094b97ca8e7cee.poster.avif?t=1760239236\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/extras/32930fe984f0b0cefa094b97ca8e7cee.webm?t=1760239236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858520?t=1760239236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/5af0befa99ec5604456510d6e88683ced692292e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760239236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/1a02ac46e00105871944fd0744351143df41d065/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760239236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858520/1a02ac46e00105871944fd0744351143df41d065/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760239236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"